    "/api/v1/subscriptions/{subscription_id}/change-plan": {
      "post": {
        "description": "When it lands is decided by the server, never asked for: a trial moves now and free; a paid\nupgrade moves now with a prorated charge for the rest of the period; a paid downgrade waits for\nthe next period; an equal-price change moves now. Ask `.../change-plan/preview` first and send\nits `expected` back. Refusals carry `errors[0].code`: 409 `state_changed`,\n`billing_catching_up`; 422 `state`, `cadence`, `currency`, `already_pinned`,\n`product_mismatch`, `not_published`, `not_offerable`, `scheduled_by_opsgrids`; 404\n`not_found`; 403 for a bundle.",
        "operationId": "change_plan_api_v1_subscriptions__subscription_id__change_plan_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "subscription_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "format": "uuid",
              "title": "Subscription Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChangePlanIn"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubscriptionOut"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Re-pin a subscription to a different published version (upgrade or downgrade)",
        "tags": [
          "subscription"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/subscriptions/{subscription_id}/change-plan/preview": {
      "post": {
        "description": "The confirm screen's server-computed answer, from the evaluation `change-plan` itself runs:\ndirection, whether it applies `now` or at the `next_period` (and when), whether a prorated\ncharge is raised now, what it replaces, the products it adds or removes \u2014 and the `expected`\nstate to send back with the write. **No amount**: a paid change is priced by the billing run\nwhen it claims the period. A refusal is part of the answer (`refusal_code`); only a missing\nsubscription or version (404) and an unreachable catalog (503) are errors.\n\nA POST because it carries a body, but a read: no row is written or locked, and no audit or\noutbox row is staged. Same permission as the write it previews.",
        "operationId": "preview_change_plan_api_v1_subscriptions__subscription_id__change_plan_preview_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "subscription_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "format": "uuid",
              "title": "Subscription Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChangePlanPreviewIn"
